nced Budget Amendment as US Nears Debt Ceiling[81] Republicans in Congress are gearing up for the coming clash over raising the debt limit and implementing spending caps with some calling for a balanced budget amendment to the U.S. Constitution. The proposals come as the U.S. is poised to reach its statutory debt limit of $31.38 trillion on Thursday, which will prompt Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen to begin using 'extraordinary measures' involving cash on hand to stave off default. [80] Biden Seen Holding 'Classified Document' In Resurfaced 2013 Photo[82] A photo has resurfaced of then-Vice President Joe Biden holding a classified document in 2013. The photo shows Biden holding a folder marked 'CODEWORD \u8212  CLASSIFIED DOCUMENT \u8212  VICE PRESIDENT' inside the Oval Office. The picture was taken on Sept. 30, 2013, as Biden prepared for a meeting between President Barack Obama and Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu. Hard copies of sensitive documents are typically only allowed in sensitive compartmented information facilities (SCIFs) \u8212  secured rooms free from cameras and other devices. [80] Breaking: Militant Outside Atlanta Autonomous Zone Shot Dead After Shooting State Trooper[83] A protestor was killed and a Georgia State Patrol trooper was shot during a Wednesday incident near the 'Cop City' occupying grounds where the Atlanta Police Department Training Facility is set to be built. The shooting took place during a 'clearing operation' at around 10 am near an Antifa-linked autonomous zone, where six were charged last month. [80] Breaking: 'Treehouse Antifa' Calls for 'Night of Rage' On Jan 20 After Cop Shoots Militant Dead Outside Atlanta in Gunfight[84] Radical Antifa-associated leftists are calling for retaliation after one of their grunts was killed in an incident with police, near the 'Cop City' occupying grounds where the Atlanta Police Department Training Facility is set to be built. 'Consider this a call for reciprocal violence to be done 